abstract: >-
  Bridge note: the electroweak (QFT) sector and the cosmological (Einstein) sector
  of the Emergence reproducibility-paper series share the same five measured
  causal-wave coefficients, the same finite loop-class library (Lemmas 1-8 plus
  pure-sync), and the same T-parity source axiom. The two sectors differ
  only in the spinor-trace component count n: QFT lives at n=1, Einstein dominates
  at n=2 and n=4. We document the bridge mapping, verify it by automated tests,
  and list the falsification paths that apply to both sectors symmetrically.
